#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
agy-advisor v3.0: Persistent Isolated Advisor Subagent System for Antigravity (agy).

Architecture:
1. Isolated Zero-Tool 1-to-1 Advisor Sessions (`--agent advisor-core` + `--conversation <advisor_cid>`):
   - Mutating sessions (`Lead` + `self` subagents; read-only `research`/`image-generator`/`*` = `off` by default)
     each get a dedicated persistent Advisor conversation without inherited `GEMINI.md`, MCPs, or tool loops.
   - Turn 1 bootstraps `<memory-context>` (`~/.agents/memories/<repo>/memory_summary.md`), `~/.agents/advisor/ADVISOR.md`,
     and hierarchical `WATCHDOG.md` (`@path` imports). Turn 2+ sends only incremental `transcript_cursor` slices + turn diff.
   - Automatic `90,000`-token context rollover starts a fresh `advisor-core` session with a Carryover Summary.
2. Commit-Aware & Pre-Dirty-WIP-Isolated Finish-Line Diff Checks (`Stop` hook):
   - Snapshots `(turn_start_head, pre_dirty_hashes)` per repo in `PreInvocation` / `PostToolUse` (zero `PreToolUse`
     permission overrides), capturing green-milestone `git commit`s (`<turn_start_head>..HEAD`), root commits,
     amended commits, and turn-edited working-tree files while ignoring untouched pre-existing dirty WIP.
   - Pure Q&A and read-only exploration turns cost `0` Advisor tokens.
3. Thrash Circuit-Breaker (`PreInvocation` hook) & Resilience Guards:
   - Diagnoses `>= 3` consecutive tool failures and injects a concrete pivot step.
   - Automatic `fallback_model` retry, 3-failure drop latch, rank-aware `EmissionGuard`, and output hazard quarantine.
4. First-Class `agy stats` Telemetry & `fcntl.flock` Concurrency Safety:
   - Lock-protected updates to `~/.agents/advisor/state.json` and `~/.agents/internal_subagents.json` plus
     self-describing Turn-1 headers (`Watched-CID`, `Watched-Role`, `Advisor-Model`, `Workspace`).
"""

